---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Main Dashboard">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Main Dashboard</h1>

    <h2>Banner Management Section</h2>
    <p>The main dashboard provides quick access to all banner functions:</p>

    <h3>1. Create New Banner Options</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>New Slide Banner</li>
      <li>New Sticky Banner</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2. Banner List View</h3>
    <p>View and manage all your created banners with the following features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Preview of all created banners</li>
      <li>
        Filter options:
        <ul>
          <li>By type (Slide/Sticky)</li>
          <li>By status (Published/Unpublished)</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>Search field for finding specific banners</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>3. Banner Actions</h3>
    <p>Each banner in the list includes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Published/Unpublished label</strong> - Indication of the publish status of the banner</li>
      <li><strong>Preview images</strong> - View a preview of your banner or slides</li>
      <li><strong>Edit button</strong> - Modify banner content and settings</li>
      <li><strong>Duplicate button</strong> - Create a copy of the banner</li>
      <li><strong>Delete button</strong> - Remove the banner</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>4. Expanded Preview</h3>
    <p>Click to expand any banner preview to see:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Detailed preview of each slide</li>
      <li>Active status indicator</li>
      <li>Scheduling information (start and end dates if applicable)</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Use the search and filter features to quickly find specific banners, especially when managing multiple campaigns.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs`} class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Getting Started
      </a>
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/creating-banners`} class="btn btn-primary">
        Next: Creating Banners →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
